* Dead grendels and ettins float away (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own
* scripts). Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder); safe to
* repeat.
*
* A dead norn lies still for 30 s, then floats up through everything above it
* and out of the top of the world, where it is removed (C2's own creature
* death script, which openc2e runs as written). The Death Update, built in
* through builtin-cobs.txt, gives grendels and ettins death scripts of their
* own: they lie for 60 s and then vanish. The owner asked (2026-11-10) for
* every creature to float away when it dies, so these replace those two:
* the same rise as a norn's, each with its own death sound. A body held by
* the hand when its time comes is let go and removed at once.
*
* The rise ignores walls and floors (attr 0). C2's script kept collisions on
* (attr 64): size 0 passes every doorway, but where solid rock has no room
* beyond (above the airlock chamber), the body hit it, bounced and lost
* speed, then sank through every floor to the bottom of the map. A dead
* ettin in the airlock did this (owner, 2026-11-10). So norns get our own
* version too: their death record (EVNT) and sound as before.
* any world: it changes objects by kind, not Eden's map, so it runs on every
* world (other Additions run only on worlds started from Eden.sfc).
scrp 4 1 0 72
  lock
  dde: died
  pose 77 addv ontr 50 snde dead evnt ownr
  wait 300
  doif movs eq 1
    mesg writ pntr 5 kill ownr
  else
    setv movs 0 setv size 0 setv attr 0 setv velx 0 setv vely -2
    loop wait 1 untl posb le 0
    kill ownr
  endi
  unlk
endm
scrp 4 2 0 72
  lock
  pose 77 addv ontr 50 snde gdie
  wait 300
  doif movs eq 1
    mesg writ pntr 5 kill ownr
  else
    setv movs 0 setv size 0 setv attr 0 setv velx 0 setv vely -2
    loop wait 1 untl posb le 0
    kill ownr
  endi
  unlk
endm
scrp 4 3 0 72
  lock
  pose 77 addv ontr 50 snde edie
  wait 300
  doif movs eq 1
    mesg writ pntr 5 kill ownr
  else
    setv movs 0 setv size 0 setv attr 0 setv velx 0 setv vely -2
    loop wait 1 untl posb le 0
    kill ownr
  endi
  unlk
endm
